## [:< ##

# name  = nshell.no-tty-debug.cmd.debug-status
# param = none
# descr = query current nshell debug state without input

## simple wrapper that delegates to char-add, which detects
## via caller() that it was invoked by this wrapper and
## skips input processing, returning just the current state

return <[nshell.no-tty-debug.cmd.char-add]>;

